{"4620430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Meet Me In The Well", "steam_appid": 4620430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Me in the Well is a frantic 4-player local arena shooter. Drop in with a revolver loaded with 6 bullets from a huge arsenal of effects, spin the chamber, and fire. Every shot pulls a random round. Some deal damage, some modify players or the arena, and some just make noise.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic local multiplayer experience for up to 4 players (no single player mode)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online support with Steam Remote Play Together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ unique bullets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A revolver that randomly selects the next bullet from your chamber</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level progression system with bullet and character unlocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support (and recommended)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match settings so you can tailor the chaos to your liking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very-versatile well</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Me in the Well is a frantic 4-player local arena shooter. Drop in with a revolver loaded with 6 bullets from a huge arsenal of effects, spin the chamber, and fire. Every shot pulls a random round. Some deal damage, some modify players or the arena, and some just make noise.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic local multiplayer experience for up to 4 players (no single player mode)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online support with Steam Remote Play Together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ unique bullets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A revolver that randomly selects the next bullet from your chamber</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level progression system with bullet and character unlocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support (and recommended)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match settings so you can tailor the chaos to your liking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very-versatile well</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Meet Me in the Well is a frantic arena shooter for up to 4 players. Play locally or online with Steam Remote Play Together. Drop in with a revolver loaded with 6 bullets from a huge arsenal of effects, spin the chamber, and fire. Every shot pulls a random round so be ready for chaos.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Polish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4620430/df364bbcb2a0f8f6f8cc2ba8c38ca24ad70a2a53/header.jpg?t=1785859488", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4620430/06a0f0ec0d31e17cb39ddc79a4d67cbe9926b4d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785859488", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4620430/06a0f0ec0d31e17cb39ddc79a4d67cbe9926b4d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785859488", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-6300 or equivalent dual-core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 520 / AMD Radeon R5 or any GPU with OpenGL 3.3<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</st